/* trips.wxss —— 我的行程列表页 WF-07（统一新视觉：渐变封面条 + 圆角卡片） */
.page { padding: 0 28rpx; background: var(--bg); }

.nav-title { font-size: 40rpx; font-weight: bold; padding: 28rpx 0 8rpx; color: var(--text-1); }

.tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 44rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 0 22rpx;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--line);
}
.tab { font-size: 30rpx; color: var(--text-3); position: relative; padding-bottom: 12rpx; }
.tab.on { color: var(--text-1); font-weight: bold; }
.tab.on::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: 0;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 48rpx;
  height: 6rpx;
  border-radius: 3rpx;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.list { margin-top: 22rpx; }

.trip-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 8rpx 24rpx rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10);
  transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
}
.trip-card:active { transform: scale(0.985); }

/* 封面条：蓝紫渐变 + 大 emoji + 城市 + 路线徽标 */
.tc-cover {
  position: relative;
  height: 200rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60A5FA, #3B82F6);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.tc-emoji { font-size: 90rpx; filter: drop-shadow(0 4rpx 8rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)); }
.tc-cover-mask {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  height: 120rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28));
}
.tc-cover-top {
  position: absolute;
  left: 24rpx; right: 24rpx; top: 20rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.tc-city {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-shadow: 0 2rpx 6rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

/* 信息区 */
.tc-body { padding: 22rpx 24rpx 24rpx; }
.tc-title { font-size: 32rpx; font-weight: bold; color: var(--text-1); }
.tc-meta { font-size: 24rpx; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: 10rpx; }
.tc-foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-top: 18rpx;
}
.tc-budget { font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: bold; color: var(--orange); }
.tc-budget .cur { font-size: 22rpx; margin-right: 2rpx; }
.tc-del {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--danger);
  background: var(--danger-light);
  padding: 8rpx 22rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
}
.tc-del:active { opacity: 0.8; }
